## The Floats added up.
##
## # Parameters
## - `a`: an array.
##
## # Returns
## The sum.
##
## # Examples
## ```pyking
## use mutation
## import array
## a = array([0.5, 1.5])
## print(array.sum(a))
## ```
## ```stdout
## 2.0
## ```
public def float::sum(a: Array(Float)) -> Float:
    list.sum(list(a))


