## A new Array of the Ints from smallest to largest; `a` is as it was
## (`sort` sorts in place).
##
## # Parameters
## - `a`: an array.
##
## # Returns
## A new Array.
##
## # Examples
## ```pyking
## use mutation
## import array
## a = array([3, 1, 2])
## print(array.sorted(a), a)
## ```
## ```stdout
## array([1, 2, 3]) array([3, 1, 2])
## ```
public def int::sorted(a: Array(Int)) -> Array(Int):
    array(list.sort(list(a)))


